<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0"><U>About Dana Incorporated</U></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0">Dana is a leader in the design and manufacture of highly efficient propulsion
and energy-management solutions that power vehicles and machines in all mobility markets across the globe. The company is shaping sustainable
progress through its conventional and clean-energy solutions that support nearly every vehicle manufacturer with drive and motion systems;
electrodynamic technologies, including software and controls; and thermal, sealing, and digital solutions.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0">Based in Maumee, Ohio, USA, the company reported sales of approximately
$7.7 billion in 2024 with 28,000 people in 22 countries across six continents. With a history dating to 1904, Dana was named among the
&quot;World's Most Ethical Companies&quot; for 2025 by Ethisphere and as one of &quot;America's Most Responsible Companies 2025&quot;
by <I>Newsweek</I>. The company is driven by a high-performance culture that focuses on valuing others, inspiring innovation, growing
responsibly, and winning together, earning it global recognition as a top employer. Learn more at dana.com.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0"><FONT STYLE="font-style: normal">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0"><FONT STYLE="font-style: normal">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

